        "parms": "# midiinfo — the machine's MIDI ports\nmidiinfo lists the MIDI ports. A bang sends how many there are, then an index and a name for each port. The index is the port argument that notein, ctlin, midiin and the other MIDI objects take, counted from 0. Its argument is input or output: which ports to list.\nMax fills a umenu from midiinfo to pick a port, and lists the ports again on every bang. Here a umenu's items are fixed, and the port is an argument: read the index, then type it after the object's name. A bang reads the ports as they were when the patch opened; refresh scans again. At most eight MIDI input objects can listen to one port.",
        "type": ".text"
      },
